+        // the vista: an establishing view along the line between the two settlements, from 150 m behind the stronghold
+        // (50 m to either side, 60 m above the ground) towards a point 30 % of the way to the village: the fortification
+        // on its high ground in the foreground, the forest, the fields and the river valley beyond, the village in the
