+### 3.13 Stage scenes (benchmark scenes A–E, the exported battle trace, weather): files used, bake outputs and runtime transformations
+
+Added 2026-11-11 by stage scenes on `g2/scenes` (cut from `g2/trunk` 21a181e). **No new external file is downloaded or
+pinned and no `manifest.tsv` row changes.** Every visual input of the five benchmark scenes is an existing row: the
