+the stage-chars clips, whose locomotion and idles are CMU-derived (B's idles, C's and D's locomotion and idles), so
+**every legend of scenes B–D names CMU motion PROTOTYPE-ONLY**. Scene A's cast (the commander, the hero soldier and
+three of the line) and the heroes of B and D (officers, the commander, the defeated officer) are posed by the authored
+kit clips only (§3.11: guards, thrust, cuts, block, hit, deaths, surrender, victory; project-owned): scene A shows no
