+
+Every legend of the sheets says *llvmpipe, not Victus evidence*; those of B, C and D also say that CMU motion
+(PROTOTYPE-ONLY) is in frame (the crowd soldiers); scene A's say that its cast is posed by the authored kit clips
+only.
